quiz.question:
阅读下面的状态机伪代码，回答：当事件序列为 ["e1", "e2"] 时，输出是什么？

states = {"A": {"e1": "B"},
          "B": {"e2": "C"},
          "C": {}}
current = "A"
for event in ["e1", "e2", "e3"]:
    if event in states[current]:
        current = states[current][event]
    else:
        current = "Unknown"
        break
print(current)
